// Module c-spinal-emergencies: acute spinal cord compression (metastatic and epidural abscess),
// cauda equina syndrome, and the patterns of traumatic spinal cord injury, including spinal shock
// and neurogenic shock. The crossing logic of the cord tracts is taught in f-localization.

