      "A pyogenic collection in the spinal epidural space, usually from bloodstream spread (most often Staphylococcus aureus), contiguous discitis or osteomyelitis, or a spinal procedure. It progresses from back pain to radicular pain, neurological deficit, and paralysis, and is treated with antibiotics and often surgical drainage.",
